Pocket 4 BELABOX RTMP HEVC patch notes:

- Maps legacy/unofficial FLV video codec ID 12 to H.265.
- Adds H.265 caps to flvdemux for hvc1 and byte-stream output.
- Uses AVC-style FLV packet offsets for codec ID 12:
  packet type at data + 8, composition time at data + 9, payload after 5 bytes.
- Stores HEVCDecoderConfigurationRecord data from packet type 0 when present.
- Supports late-subscriber fallback when nginx-rtmp does not replay codec data.
- Converts 4-byte length-prefixed HEVC NAL units to Annex B byte-stream in fallback.
- Logs the missing-codec-data fallback warning only once per stream/pipeline start.
- Leaves H.264 codec ID 7 behavior unchanged.

